cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "miku-to-humanoid"
abstract: >-
  MMD (PMX + VMD/VPD) motion retargeting onto humanoid robots. The source side never goes through
  glTF or a MuJoCo qpos round trip: the deform pipeline yields per-bone world poses, the frame
  correspondence C is read from one paired pose, and GMR's IK turns that into robot qpos.
